{"role": "tool", "content": "command: hops job --help\nstdout: Usage: hops job [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...\n\n  Job commands.\n\nOptions:\n  --json                  Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs and\n                          scripts).\n  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify\n                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-\n                          mismatched certs.\n  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.\n\nCommands:\n  backfill       Run ``name`` once over an explicit [start_time,...\n  create         Create a new job from a ``type`` + ``--app-path``.\n  delete         Delete a job definition (does not affect past execution...\n  deploy         Deploy a job end to end: upload, set environment,...\n  history        List past executions of a job (newest first).\n  info           Show the configuration of a single job.\n  list           List every job defined in the active project.\n  logs           Read stdout/stderr logs for a job execution.\n  run            Start a new one-off execution of ``name``.\n  schedule       Attach (or update) a Quartz cron schedule to ``name``.\n  schedule-info  Print the currently attached schedule, if any.\n  stop           Stop the most recent execution of ``name``.\n  unschedule     Remove the schedule from a job.\n\nstderr: \nreturncode: 0", "injected": false, "name": "bash", "tool_call_id": "WUHO3GBSf"}
